sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User

    box "Frontend"
    participant UI as index.html
    end

    box "Backend (FastAPI)"
    participant API as app.py
    participant RAG as retrieve.py
    end

    box "Data Ingestion"
    participant Ingest as ingest.py
    participant DB as ChromaDB
    end

    box "External Services"
    participant HF as HuggingFace (Embeddings)
    participant LLM as Gemini / NVIDIA
    end

    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
    Note over Ingest, DB: 1. Data Ingestion Phase (Offline)
    Ingest->>Ingest: Read PDFs & Clean Text
    Ingest->>Ingest: Hierarchical Chunking (Nodes)
    Ingest->>HF: Get Embeddings for Nodes
    HF-->>Ingest: Vector Embeddings
    Ingest->>DB: Store Vectors & Metadata
    end

    rect rgb(200, 200, 255)
    Note over User, LLM: 2. Retrieval & Chat Phase (Runtime)
    User->>UI: Enter Query
    UI->>API: POST /chat {query}
    API->>RAG: answer_query(query)
    RAG->>LLM: Expand Query (HyDE Prompt)
    LLM-->>RAG: Expanded Query
    RAG->>HF: Embed Expanded Query
    HF-->>RAG: Query Vector
    RAG->>DB: Vector Search (top_k=10)
    DB-->>RAG: Retrieve Documents (Nodes)
    RAG->>RAG: Rerank Nodes (SentenceTransformer)
    RAG->>LLM: Prompt + Context + Original Query
    LLM-->>RAG: Generated Answer
    RAG-->>API: ChatResponse {answer, sources}
    API-->>UI: JSON Response
    UI-->>User: Display Answer & Sources
    end
